        <div class="inspire-bg-overly"></div>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xl-12">
                    <div class="inspire__left">
                        <div class="inspire__carousel owl-theme owl-carousel">
                            <div class="inspire__single">
                                <div class="inspire__quote">
                                    <span class="icon-quote"></span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="inspire__text">"Shedfactory has been instrumental in our digital journey. They manage our social media with exceptional strategic communication. Our online presence has grown significantly, and they've helped us connect with our community in meaningful ways."</p>
