                                    <p class="inspire__clinet-title">Radiant Life Day Centre</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="inspire__single">
                                <div class="inspire__quote">
                                    <span class="icon-quote"></span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="inspire__text">"Shedfactory didn't just create our brand identity and website—they built us a complete recruitment portal that streamlines our hiring process. Their strategic approach to our digital presence has been instrumental in Serinity Healthkare's growth."</p>
                                <div class="inspire__client-info">
                                    <h4 class="inspire__clinet-name">Maureen, CEO</h4>
                                    <p class="inspire__clinet-title">Serinity Healthkare</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="inspire__single">
                                <div class="inspire__quote">
                                    <span class="icon-quote"></span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="inspire__text">"The website Shedfactory created for Savoy Summerset Hotel perfectly captures the elegance and luxury of our property. It's visually stunning and has received wonderful feedback from our guests."</p>
                                <div class="inspire__client-info">
                                    <h4 class="inspire__clinet-name">Lanre, Manager</h4>
                                    <p class="inspire__clinet-title">Savoy Summerset Hotel</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="inspire__single">
                                <div class="inspire__quote">
                                    <span class="icon-quote"></span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="inspire__text">"Shedfactory built us a website and booking engine that transformed how we manage reservations. The system is intuitive, seamless, and has significantly increased our direct bookings."</p>
                                <div class="inspire__client-info">
                                    <h4 class="inspire__clinet-name">Chike Okoroafor</h4>
                                    <p class="inspire__clinet-title">Full Moon Hotels</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<!-- Testimonial End -->

<!-- CTA Start -->
<section class="cta-one">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-one__inner">
            <div class="cta-one__left">
                <h2 class="cta-one__title">Ready to grow your audience?</h2>
                <p class="cta-one__subtitle">Let’s create a marketing strategy that delivers.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="cta-one__button">
                <a href="/contact" class="thm-btn cta-one__btn">Start Your Project</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<!-- CTA End -->

<%- include('partials/footer') %>